          "block_order": 1
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "$A D//B C$ $\\Delta M A D\\sim\\Delta M B C$ ∴相化比为$\\frac{A D}{B C}=\\frac{8}{10}=\\frac{4}{5}=\\frac{M A}{M B}=\\frac{M D}{M C}$ △mB(周长△MAD周长=$\\frac{3}{}$ \n\n$\\frac{M A}{M B}=\\frac{4}{5}\\therefore\\frac{M A}{M A+4}=\\frac{4}{5}\\therefore M A=16$ \n$\\frac{M D}{M C}=\\frac{4}{5}\\therefore\\frac{M D}{M D+5}=\\frac{4}{5}\\therefore M D=20$ \n$\\Delta M A D 固私 =M A+A D+M D=16+8+20$ ∴由①②可矢O.△MBC周长=55",
          "block_bbox": [
            246,
            1929,
            2036,
            3310
          ],
          "block_id": 4,
          "block_order": 2
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "（微信公众号：实用视界）免费分享",
          "block_bbox": [
            71,
