            3450
          ],
          "block_id": 5,
          "block_order": 3
        }
      ],
      "markdown": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_694_386_1864_1426.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"47%\" /></div>\n\n\n看到平行再看到周长相似比=周长比\n\n$A D//B C$ $\\Delta M A D\\sim\\Delta M B C$ ∴相化比为$\\frac{A D}{B C}=\\frac{8}{10}=\\frac{4}{5}=\\frac{M A}{M B}=\\frac{M D}{M C}$ △mB(周长△MAD周长=$\\frac{3}{}$ \n\n$\\frac{M A}{M B}=\\frac{4}{5}\\therefore\\frac{M A}{M A+4}=\\frac{4}{5}\\therefore M A=16$ \n\n$\\frac{M D}{M C}=\\frac{4}{5}\\therefore\\frac{M D}{M D+5}=\\frac{4}{5}\\therefore M D=20$ \n\n$\\Delta M A D 固私 =M A+A D+M D=16+8+20$ ∴由①②可矢O.△MBC周长=55\n\n（微信公众号：实用视界）免费分享",
